 "notes": [
  "Posted 10 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "No starting section is posted; the strategy starts the objective with Rendezvous Point and Ord Mantell (Hidden Base indicator) and plays Heading For The Medical Frigate, choosing three of Insurrection, Menace Fades, Battle Plan, Squadron Assignments and Your Insight Serves You Well. All are in the normal sections and count toward the 60; no single starting Effect is named.",
  "Update #2 says the card list is 'messed up' and that a Fall Of The Legend or Throw Me Another Charge should be swapped for Insurrection; Insurrection is not in the posted list, so it is not added.",
  "Posted 'Qui-Gon's Lightsaber' dested Qui-Gon Jinn's Lightsaber (Tatooine set; Qui-Gon's Lightsaber is a later Reflections III card). 'Dagobah' dested the Light Dagobah (Dagobah (Light)). 'Jar-Jar Binks' dested Jar Jar Binks. 'Cloud City Platform 327 (Docking Bay)', 'Dagobah Yoda's Hut', 'Home One Docking Bay' and 'Tatooine Docking Bay 94' dested the site pages.",
  "Byline is Andrew \"MasterYoda13\" Howard; credited to the existing Andrew Howard page (same name; nothing links this DeckTech player to that page beyond the name).",
  "Total is 60 as published."
